---
---

<section id="architecture" class="py-20 md:py-28 max-w-5xl mx-auto px-6">
  <!-- Section Tag -->
  <div class="flex items-center gap-2 mb-4 font-mono text-xs uppercase tracking-wider text-[#7A7268]">
    <span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-[#0B7A5A]"></span>
    <span>System Architecture</span>
    <span class="text-[#D5CCC0]">•</span>
    <span>LangGraph & DeepAgents</span>
  </div>

  <div class="max-w-2xl mb-12">
    <h2 class="font-serif text-3xl sm:text-4xl lg:text-[44px] font-normal text-[#26221E] leading-[1.2] mb-4">
      Deterministic state machines over <span class="italic font-serif text-[#0B7A5A]">uncontrolled loops</span>.
    </h2>
    <p class="text-base sm:text-lg text-[#6B635B] leading-relaxed">
      Most coding agents rely on a single, continuous prompt loop that degrades over long horizons. Phil models development as a deterministic state machine with verifiable contracts between specialized agents.
    </p>
  </div>

  <!-- Architecture Visual Breakdown Cards -->
  <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-6 mb-12">
    <!-- Component 1: LangGraph State Machine -->
    <div class="p-6 rounded-2xl bg-[#F4EFEA] border border-[#E5DDD3] shadow-xs flex flex-col justify-between">
      <div>
        <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-[#FAF8F5] border border-[#D5CCC0] flex items-center justify-center text-sm font-mono text-[#0B7A5A] mb-4 font-bold">
          01
        </div>
        <h3 class="font-serif text-xl font-medium text-[#26221E] mb-2">LangGraph Core</h3>
        <p class="text-xs text-[#6B635B] leading-relaxed mb-4">
          All workflows (intake, classification, planning, task implementation, verification, and PR creation) are compiled into explicit LangGraph nodes and conditional edges.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="pt-4 border-t border-[#E5DDD3] text-[11px] font-mono text-[#7A7268] space-y-1">
        <div>• SQLite state checkpointing</div>
        <div>• Seamless <code class="text-[#26221E]">/resume</code> on crash or stop</div>
        <div>• Serializable run telemetry</div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Component 2: DeepAgents Delegation -->
    <div class="p-6 rounded-2xl bg-[#F4EFEA] border border-[#E5DDD3] shadow-xs flex flex-col justify-between">
      <div>
        <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-[#FAF8F5] border border-[#D5CCC0] flex items-center justify-center text-sm font-mono text-[#6D28D9] mb-4 font-bold">
          02
        </div>
        <h3 class="font-serif text-xl font-medium text-[#26221E] mb-2">DeepAgents Delegation</h3>
        <p class="text-xs text-[#6B635B] leading-relaxed mb-4">
          High-level agents can spawn focused subagents for isolated deep exploration without bloating the parent agent's context window with thousands of tool call tokens.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="pt-4 border-t border-[#E5DDD3] text-[11px] font-mono text-[#7A7268] space-y-1">
        <div>• Subagent token isolation</div>
        <div>• Context summarization circuit-breakers</div>
        <div>• Transparent per-call accounting</div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Component 3: Worktree Isolation -->
    <div class="p-6 rounded-2xl bg-[#F4EFEA] border border-[#E5DDD3] shadow-xs flex flex-col justify-between">
      <div>
        <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-[#FAF8F5] border border-[#D5CCC0] flex items-center justify-center text-sm font-mono text-[#C26910] mb-4 font-bold">
          03
        </div>
        <h3 class="font-serif text-xl font-medium text-[#26221E] mb-2">Worktree Sandboxing</h3>
        <p class="text-xs text-[#6B635B] leading-relaxed mb-4">
          Runs never modify your active working directory. Every task executes inside an ephemeral <code class="text-[#26221E]">.phil/worktrees/&lt;id&gt;</code> linked to a dedicated git branch.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="pt-4 border-t border-[#E5DDD3] text-[11px] font-mono text-[#7A7268] space-y-1">
        <div>• Zero dirty-tree corruption</div>
        <div>• Automatic cleanup after merge</div>
        <div>• Multi-run background concurrency</div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- Tech Stack Ribbon -->
  <div class="p-6 rounded-2xl bg-[#FAF8F5] border border-[#E5DDD3] flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-6 text-xs font-mono text-[#6B635B]">
    <div class="text-[#26221E] font-medium font-sans text-sm">Under the Hood:</div>
    <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-6">
      <span class="flex items-center gap-1.5"><span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#0B7A5A]"></span>Python 3.14+</span>
      <span class="flex items-center gap-1.5"><span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#6D28D9]"></span>LangGraph 1.2</span>
      <span class="flex items-center gap-1.5"><span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#C26910]"></span>DeepAgents 0.7</span>
      <span class="flex items-center gap-1.5"><span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#B45309]"></span>Rich & Typer</span>
      <span class="flex items-center gap-1.5"><span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#1E40AF]"></span>Prompt-Toolkit</span>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
